  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To Increase Access to Safe Water, Sanitation and Hygiene in Ethiopia through the UN agency for Capital</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity To Increase Access to Safe Water, Sanitation and Hygiene in Ethiopia through the UN agency for Capital is a component of Water, Sanitation and Hygiene (One WASH) Programme reported by FCDO with a funding type of 109 - Multilateral organisation and a budget of &#xa3;11,540,000. It works in the following sector(s): Basic drinking water supply and basic sanitation, Waste management/disposal, Sanitation - large systems, Water sector policy and administrative management, Education and training in water supply and sanitation.</narrative>
  </description>
